##Day 2 - Service & Tags

## 1 Ansible — Install & Enable NginxAnsible — Install & Enable Nginx

---
- name: Install and start Nginx on Pathnex
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Install nginx
      yum: 
        name: nginx
        state: present

    - name: Enable Nginx
      service: 
        name: nginx
        state: started 
        enabled: yes
---
